WEBVTT

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.780
What the hell is going on?

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.290
This amount of rain is not normal!

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:47.990
L-Lord Koenma!

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:49.560
What is it?!

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:51.630
The river Styx is...!

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:15.140
Hurry!

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:47.280
Water has broken through the Gate of Judgment!

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.580
There's a crack in the upper part of the Gate...!

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:51.660
Take the important files!

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:54.150
W-What shall we do?

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:56.560
- Lord Koenma!
- What is it?

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.540
The Second and Third Levels have been submerged!

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.630
If this keeps up, all the gates will be in danger!

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:14.540
The shield has collapsed! It cannot be repaired!

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:18.680
It is dangerous, Lord Koenma. Please seek refuge!

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.220
What's the matter with you, Lord?!

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.620
I don't believe it...!

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:29.220
Summon Botan! I will be in the Great Vault!

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:32.890
But, my Lord, now is not the time to--

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.600
Hurry up!

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.940
Lord Koenma!

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:52.340
Lord Koenma!

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.860
I'm here, Botan!

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:08.200
Lord Koenma!

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.210
Lord Koenma!

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:27.850
This cannot end up in their hands!

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.650
Hurry and take it to Yusuke!

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:34.350
There is no other way to save the Spirit World.

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:37.120
- Do you understand?
- Y-Yes!

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:41.160
Go, Botan! I must remain here.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:43.130
Okay!

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:52.010
Go, Botan!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.970
Hurry!

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:16.200
L-Lord Koenma!

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:43.830
<b>B O N D S   O F   F I R E</b>

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.310
Where did he go now?

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.050
Boy, I'm hungry.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.820
Maybe I should just eat my lunch now.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.900
B-Botan!

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:34.240
What happened, Botan? Talk to me!

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:38.240
What happened to you?

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.540
T-The Spirit World is...

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:43.280
The Spirit World, the Spirit World is...!

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:46.260
The Spirit World is what?

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.290
Botan!

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:53.020
W-We must go to Kasane Shrine and find Hinageshi.

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.600
What?!

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:58.370
P-Please, Yusuke.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:01.870
Botan!

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.450
Keiko!

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:11.210
What happened, Botan?!

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.220
I don't know what's going on.

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:16.790
Botan...

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:21.880
Keiko, would you hurry and take Botan to Genkai's temple?

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:28.830
So, what is at Kasane Shrine?

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:31.560
- I don't know.
- You don't know?!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:35.330
You didn't find out any details?

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.640
There was no time for that!

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:39.900
You're not any use at all.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:42.810
I would have found out everything from start to--

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:47.910
Over there!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.850
You bastard!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.200
What do you want?

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.200
Get away from me!

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.230
Shotgun!

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:02.190
Don't worry.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.520
Die!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.530
Spirit Sword!

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:25.640
Oops. Didn't mean to do that...

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:34.250
- Are you all right?
- Y-Yes!

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:37.560
You two are investigators from the Spirit World, aren't you?

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.130
And you are...?

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:42.360
My name is Hinageshi. I am a guide of the Spirit World.

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:54.040
Botan!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:01.170
What is this? What could have...?!

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:18.900
How is her condition?

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:21.630
It's in the balance.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:25.800
Something serious must have happened to the Spirit World.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.510
Kurama!

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:39.090
The Spirit World...was gone.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:41.220
What?!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:53.230
Actually, that is not accurate. I should say it was covered by water.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:55.300
B-But why?

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:59.240
Some immeasurably strong power must have gained control.

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:00.870
No way...

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:05.040
What could have the power to do that?

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:06.670
When I was there,

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:10.650
some phantoms wearing the pattern of a cross on their foreheads...

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.380
were looking for something.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:16.590
It must have been the Netherworld!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.270
The Netherworld...?

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.270
Right.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:26.830
Those phantoms were demons controlled by the Netherworld.

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:29.600
Their symbol is that cross.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.970
Hold it. What is this "Netherworld"?

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:36.340
As far as I know, there are just the Human World, the Spirit World,

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:38.210
and the Demon World.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:42.750
Ah, here it is.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.620
To begin with,

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:48.630
above the Human World lies the Spirit World.

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:50.660
The two of them are in balance.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.560
Well, humans who have died do go to the Spirit World.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.600
And the Netherworld was originally...

00:10:56.700 --> 00:11:00.800
above and in balance with the Demon World.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:02.960
Then, several thousand years ago,

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:06.170
the Netherworld began a war with the Spirit World...

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:09.580
in order to gain possession of the Human World.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:14.020
Exactly how we were able to defeat them is unknown...

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:18.750
but Emperor Enma did finally destroy the Netherworld and...

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:24.090
banish their King Yakumo and his men to the darkness of space.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:28.390
So, how did the Netherworld come back into existence?

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:33.490
If the Netherworld is responsible for this disturbance...

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:37.970
it could become a very dangerous situation.

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:45.270
We cannot repel them alone.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.210
The Netherworld...

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:18.840
In any case, it has nothing to do with me.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.920
Yukina is here?

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:33.600
Yukina!

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:36.260
She's with Botan.

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:44.440
Hello, Yukina! How've you been?

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.550
Yukina...

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.870
Kazuma...

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:57.280
I'm sorry. I'm glad to see you, but...

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:59.550
Don't.

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:03.720
But, why is Botan...?

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:08.420
An unhappy face like that doesn't suit you, Yukina.

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:14.400
I, Kazuma Kuwabara, shall resolve everything!

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:18.300
Soon we will all be smiling happily again.

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.250
Yukina!

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:27.110
A-Are you all right?

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:30.190
Your temperature is going up and up.

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:33.410
That is the power of love.

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:39.930
He is so hard to understand.

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:45.460
You're in the way, Kuwabara.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:50.070
Yukina...

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:55.900
Why don't you tell Yukina that you are her older brother?

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:58.410
I don't need your advice.

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:03.950
Hiei...

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:08.390
You saw the condition of the Spirit World, too.

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:11.320
This is no ordinary event.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.430
How would I know?

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:29.040
What should we do, Hinageshi?

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:32.780
We have to transmit power to the Spirit World.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:34.680
How?

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:36.950
Look.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:39.110
There are places in the Human World called...

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:42.190
elemental sites which naturally collect Spirit Energy.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.630
Elemental sites?

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:48.100
You mean storage tanks for Spirit Energy?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.330
Yes, something like that.

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:57.130
There are five of these elemental sites...

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:04.210
representing the Earth, Wind, Fire, Water, and the Spirit.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:06.340
If they all are unsealed,

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:10.720
that amassed Spirit Energy will be sent to the Spirit World.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:14.890
And with that power it would be restored!

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:17.290
- Right.
- So, where are they?

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.260
I know where!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.860
All right! Leave it to me!

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:50.890
Come, my servants!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.290
Are you here?

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:20.580
Your three demon gods have arrived, Lord Yakumo.

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.660
Our strategy has entered the second stage.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:30.370
Make the power of the elemental sites ours.

00:16:30.470 --> 00:16:32.800
- Go!
- Yes, Lord.

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:52.220
Okay, turn at this corner, so north is behind you...

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.290
Where the hell is it?

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.390
Hold on a minute!

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:01.460
I-Is this an earthquake?

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.560
What's that?

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:04.760
It's...

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:09.970
It's the elemental site representing Earth!

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:12.410
- What?!
- Let's hurry, Yusuke!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:20.580
W-What's going on?

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.890
What the...?!

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.460
This is no good!

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.830
What do you mean?

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:37.400
Look at that color.

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:39.800
The elemental site has been destroyed.

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:42.370
What is streaming out is not Spirit Energy...

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:44.100
but the power of the Netherworld!

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:45.940
What?!

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:52.980
Those demons are able to convert Spirit Energy to Netherworld power.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:54.880
So, that Netherworld power--

00:17:55.590 --> 00:18:00.580
If they steal the power from each of the elemental sites, then...

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:02.250
Then...?

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:05.560
The Spirit World will remain inaccessible!

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:08.760
And there will be nothing we can do!

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.170
- Right.
- Let's hurry!

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:15.670
They may be ahead of us. We must protect the other sites!

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:18.940
- Okay!
- Let's split up!

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:23.640
I can't even repay Botan the kindness I owe her.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.220
Kindness?

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:28.580
I always made mistakes and caused a lot of problems for Botan.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.990
- And now I can't--
- You're wrong.

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:33.490
It's too early to give up!

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:36.890
Umm...

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.620
Oh, it's this way! Up these stairs!

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:41.200
Okay.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.930
Hurry up!

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:49.540
What's wrong?

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:53.640
Everything is completely different!

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:24.680
It crumbled just like that!

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:37.190
Netherworld demons.

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:39.790
They got here ahead of us again!

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:42.190
We may still make it!

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:44.360
Wait!

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:08.610
Look! That's the elemental site of Fire!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.210
What?!

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.290
Hold it!

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:17.060
Don't touch that!

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:39.350
It's over, Hinageshi! What do we do now?

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:42.740
What, more?

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:49.680
Hinageshi!

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:56.700
Damn!

00:20:57.140 --> 00:20:59.570
My body is... No!

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:02.540
Stop! What is this?!

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.710
S-Stop!

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:23.220
No. This girl is not the one.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:25.330
Wait!

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:30.030
It seems your friend is still here.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:34.530
Stop, you!

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.540
You really did it now.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.320
You bastard!

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:53.480
Damn!

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:13.140
You are not a normal human, are you?

00:22:13.510 --> 00:22:15.500
You must be a tool of the Spirit World.

00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:27.020
Who are you?!

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:31.320
I am Yakumo, king of the Netherworld.

00:22:34.070 --> 00:22:36.760
It's Yakumo!

00:22:38.740 --> 00:22:40.700
Here we go, Yakumo!

00:22:40.910 --> 00:22:42.700
Spirit Gun!

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:48.170
It didn't get through!

00:22:48.910 --> 00:22:51.810
Your Spirit Energy is nothing.

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:54.820
Get out of here!

00:23:10.540 --> 00:23:12.400
Yusuke! Are you okay?!

00:23:22.450 --> 00:23:24.010
Yusuke!

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:28.310
Yakumo, king of the Netherworld...
But why is he...?

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:02.310
D-Damn.

00:24:16.530 --> 00:24:19.990
The Power Sphere... source of our energy...

00:24:20.100 --> 00:24:24.040
Plundered in the past by the Spirit World...

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.400
Once it has been returned, our hopes will finally be realized.

00:24:30.880 --> 00:24:35.010
The leaders of the Spirit World must have hidden it well.

00:24:35.120 --> 00:24:39.110
They would not let it be protected by such small fry.

00:24:39.820 --> 00:24:44.020
Where is it? Where did they hide it?

00:24:59.240 --> 00:25:01.470
This must be the elemental site of the Soul.

00:25:01.580 --> 00:25:03.910
All right, time to open it up.

00:25:07.850 --> 00:25:09.320
What's that?

00:25:23.700 --> 00:25:25.170
Fools are amusing.

00:25:26.040 --> 00:25:28.060
W-Who are you?

00:25:36.050 --> 00:25:39.450
I am Majari, one of the three demon gods of the Netherworld.

00:25:39.550 --> 00:25:41.850
I shall destroy that elemental site.

00:25:41.950 --> 00:25:44.420
What did you say? You think I'll let you do that?

00:25:44.790 --> 00:25:47.090
I shall kill anyone in my way.

00:25:48.590 --> 00:25:50.560
Aren't you superior?

00:25:50.660 --> 00:25:52.630
Spirit Sword!

00:25:53.230 --> 00:25:55.700
Looks interesting.

00:25:55.800 --> 00:25:57.270
Bastard!

00:25:57.370 --> 00:25:58.890
Spirit Sword!

00:26:01.270 --> 00:26:03.970
Let me show you what I am known for.

00:26:04.080 --> 00:26:07.410
I can mirror my opponents.

00:26:07.510 --> 00:26:10.240
I have copied your skills and your ideas.

00:26:10.350 --> 00:26:12.250
You have no chance at victory.

00:26:12.450 --> 00:26:15.390
Say that after we've fought!

00:26:31.600 --> 00:26:33.570
Bastard.

00:26:46.280 --> 00:26:48.250
It's over there!

00:27:11.580 --> 00:27:13.370
Don't mess with me!

00:28:04.860 --> 00:28:06.330
All right.

00:28:07.060 --> 00:28:09.360
I have taken your past.

00:28:15.810 --> 00:28:17.270
Who is that?

00:28:18.180 --> 00:28:19.640
"Who is that?"

00:28:19.810 --> 00:28:23.250
I can't believe you would say that to your old partner.

00:28:24.050 --> 00:28:25.710
Kuronue...

00:28:26.050 --> 00:28:31.720
Or do you mean to say you have forgotten your terrible past?

00:28:41.230 --> 00:28:43.100
Kurama Yoko.

00:28:43.200 --> 00:28:45.400
You are still alive!

00:28:46.940 --> 00:28:49.740
Try to remember that day.

00:28:50.270 --> 00:28:53.330
That day we snuck into the palace of the Demon World.

00:29:21.770 --> 00:29:24.400
- Don't, Kuronue!
- I need it!

00:29:34.420 --> 00:29:36.390
Kuronue!

00:29:37.590 --> 00:29:39.520
Traitor!

00:29:43.030 --> 00:29:47.900
You deliberately cut my pendant in order to trap me!

00:29:48.270 --> 00:29:52.030
You sacrificed me so that you alone could escape!

00:29:54.940 --> 00:29:58.340
You're wrong! That's ridiculous.

00:29:59.110 --> 00:30:03.070
How dare you say that after trying to kill me!

00:30:03.450 --> 00:30:05.420
What are you talking about? That day, I...

00:30:06.250 --> 00:30:09.620
I... To save you, I...

00:30:09.720 --> 00:30:12.780
You set a trap for me. Then...

00:30:12.890 --> 00:30:17.290
you left me to die while you saved yourself.

00:30:18.630 --> 00:30:20.600
Take this!

00:30:40.650 --> 00:30:42.780
Wait, Kuronue!

00:30:48.690 --> 00:30:52.130
It appears that we have opened the other sites.

00:30:53.260 --> 00:30:55.130
Shoot!

00:31:03.340 --> 00:31:05.430
- Kuwabara!
- Wait!

00:31:05.540 --> 00:31:07.740
Look at his weapon!

00:31:09.910 --> 00:31:11.380
A Spirit Sword!

00:31:11.480 --> 00:31:16.820
That demon is able to mirror his opponent's techniques.

00:31:16.920 --> 00:31:21.090
He is Majari, one of the three demon gods of the Netherworld.

00:31:21.190 --> 00:31:22.960
- What...?
- You can't help!

00:31:23.060 --> 00:31:26.760
If you try, he'll steal your techniques, too!

00:31:38.980 --> 00:31:40.640
Now, we finish it.

00:31:42.650 --> 00:31:44.140
Kuwabara!

00:31:45.480 --> 00:31:47.110
Stop joking around!

00:31:47.320 --> 00:31:51.720
Even if this is the end, I will never let you have it.

00:31:52.120 --> 00:31:54.090
Here!

00:32:00.100 --> 00:32:04.230
Not bad. Though I will not be defeated either.

00:32:04.700 --> 00:32:07.330
You don't have any more tricks, do you?

00:32:07.470 --> 00:32:09.740
I won't be careless again.

00:32:11.280 --> 00:32:13.180
Fool!

00:32:13.310 --> 00:32:16.070
I just developed a new killing technique!

00:32:19.380 --> 00:32:21.350
What?!

00:32:30.390 --> 00:32:32.160
Impressive...

00:32:32.260 --> 00:32:35.760
releasing your entire store of Spirit Energy at once.

00:32:35.970 --> 00:32:38.760
Thank you for teaching me how.

00:32:58.860 --> 00:33:00.720
Pitiful bastard.

00:33:04.530 --> 00:33:06.000
I caught you!

00:33:06.400 --> 00:33:07.920
Kuwabara.

00:33:08.030 --> 00:33:11.870
Now you're all out of energy, too, Majari.

00:33:11.970 --> 00:33:13.440
What...?

00:33:15.370 --> 00:33:18.000
I'm telling you it's useless!

00:33:20.850 --> 00:33:22.750
Y-You...

00:33:22.850 --> 00:33:26.340
There is something I'm proud of too.

00:33:28.590 --> 00:33:30.580
In a true contest of guts...

00:33:32.020 --> 00:33:33.510
I have...

00:33:34.290 --> 00:33:35.950
never been...

00:33:36.060 --> 00:33:38.360
beaten!

00:33:49.470 --> 00:33:51.410
I win.

00:33:51.510 --> 00:33:52.980
That's it.

00:33:54.410 --> 00:33:55.880
Kuwabara!

00:33:59.480 --> 00:34:01.970
Hey, Kuwabara!

00:34:03.690 --> 00:34:06.660
Hurry and unseal it.

00:34:09.060 --> 00:34:12.150
Watch out! Jump, Yusuke!

00:34:12.260 --> 00:34:13.730
Hiei!

00:34:15.800 --> 00:34:17.990
The final site...!

00:34:58.840 --> 00:35:00.310
With this,

00:35:00.410 --> 00:35:04.370
the basis for the restoration of the Netherworld is complete.

00:35:05.950 --> 00:35:07.650
Lord Yakumo...

00:35:07.750 --> 00:35:09.220
Is it definite?

00:35:09.320 --> 00:35:12.980
Yes. One more female from the Spirit World exists.

00:35:16.930 --> 00:35:19.990
I have waited many years for this...

00:35:20.360 --> 00:35:24.660
the moment the Netherworld will be restored on new territory.

00:35:40.550 --> 00:35:43.580
W-Where are we? Are we alive?

00:35:44.960 --> 00:35:46.720
Look!

00:35:50.830 --> 00:35:54.990
It appears that we were somehow flung over here.

00:35:55.100 --> 00:35:57.360
What do we do now?

00:36:38.380 --> 00:36:40.070
That must be it.

00:36:40.180 --> 00:36:45.010
A shield has been built around the area the Netherworld appeared in.

00:36:45.520 --> 00:36:50.580
Why isn't the city in an uproar?

00:36:50.690 --> 00:36:53.120
That is the power of the Netherworld.

00:36:53.220 --> 00:36:57.090
Nobody is noticing things that they normally would.

00:36:58.400 --> 00:36:59.990
Where's Yusuke?

00:37:00.100 --> 00:37:03.530
Keiko was going to get a change of clothes,

00:37:03.630 --> 00:37:06.360
and he said he was going with her to check on Botan.

00:37:10.740 --> 00:37:12.210
What's wrong, Hiei?

00:37:12.340 --> 00:37:15.710
If no one has a good plan, I'll take care of it myself.

00:37:44.440 --> 00:37:46.410
Botan!

00:37:47.110 --> 00:37:49.640
There is tremendous energy.

00:37:56.620 --> 00:37:58.210
Who are you?

00:37:58.360 --> 00:37:59.820
Shall I...?

00:37:59.920 --> 00:38:02.150
Don't bother.

00:38:03.590 --> 00:38:05.060
This is my temple!

00:38:05.160 --> 00:38:08.150
How dare you enter without permission!

00:38:15.870 --> 00:38:17.340
He's strong!

00:38:22.580 --> 00:38:25.810
What?! She is able to repel Lord Yakumo's ghostly power!

00:38:34.960 --> 00:38:36.930
That is it.

00:38:37.900 --> 00:38:39.860
Wait!

00:39:08.360 --> 00:39:10.330
S-Stay away!

00:39:14.260 --> 00:39:17.930
So, it was actually true.

00:39:18.770 --> 00:39:20.290
Stay away!

00:39:31.180 --> 00:39:35.310
The Power Sphere is inside this girl's body.

00:39:37.490 --> 00:39:40.720
What's that? Stay here, Keiko!

00:39:40.820 --> 00:39:42.290
Yusuke!

00:39:51.740 --> 00:39:53.400
Hold it!

00:40:04.080 --> 00:40:05.950
You bastard!

00:40:09.950 --> 00:40:11.780
You again?

00:40:11.920 --> 00:40:15.410
You can't stand the fact that I beat you.

00:40:15.790 --> 00:40:17.280
Like a whipped dog.

00:40:17.390 --> 00:40:19.230
What did you say?

00:40:19.430 --> 00:40:21.400
Yusuke!

00:40:23.270 --> 00:40:24.730
Keiko!

00:40:28.940 --> 00:40:30.600
Learn your place!

00:40:37.280 --> 00:40:42.240
I, Yakumo, have retrieved the Power Sphere of the Netherworld!

00:40:45.120 --> 00:40:47.390
Power... Sphere...?

00:40:47.720 --> 00:40:50.850
The moment of the Netherworld's restoration has arrived.

00:40:51.030 --> 00:40:54.190
This is the source of our power!

00:40:59.470 --> 00:41:01.030
B-Botan!

00:41:13.580 --> 00:41:17.250
- Are you injured?
- I am fine.

00:41:28.270 --> 00:41:30.230
Yukina...

00:41:31.670 --> 00:41:33.260
Yukina!

00:41:35.210 --> 00:41:37.230
She just fell asleep.

00:41:46.620 --> 00:41:48.590
Damn...!

00:41:56.730 --> 00:42:00.990
Yusuke, Keiko's injuries are not serious.

00:42:10.070 --> 00:42:15.010
Those bastards said they had found a Power Sphere inside of Botan.

00:42:16.250 --> 00:42:21.210
Now they have the Power Sphere, the source of their energy--

00:42:21.590 --> 00:42:24.280
Even though they have retrieved the Power Sphere...

00:42:24.390 --> 00:42:26.250
the Netherworld is extinct.

00:42:26.360 --> 00:42:29.120
With no place to go and the Spirit World disempowered...

00:42:29.230 --> 00:42:31.690
Yakumo and his brethren have one aim in mind.

00:42:31.800 --> 00:42:33.260
Right.

00:42:33.360 --> 00:42:36.890
It is to obtain their true restoration here in the Human World.

00:42:38.600 --> 00:42:40.400
Botan probably knew that...

00:42:40.500 --> 00:42:44.000
when Koenma entrusted her with the Power Sphere.

00:42:44.110 --> 00:42:49.740
She hid it inside her own body so that those demons wouldn't find it.

00:42:50.110 --> 00:42:51.740
She risked her own life...

00:42:51.850 --> 00:42:56.150
knowing that its power would overwhelm her like that.

00:42:57.890 --> 00:43:01.350
And we never realized.

00:43:14.400 --> 00:43:18.200
If only I had some Spirit Energy remaining...

00:43:30.850 --> 00:43:34.220
You left me for dead.

00:43:54.210 --> 00:43:56.980
Botan...

00:43:58.380 --> 00:44:01.510
You wanted me to notice.

00:44:01.890 --> 00:44:05.690
If only I had been more aware...

00:44:07.720 --> 00:44:09.620
I'm so sorry.

00:44:18.140 --> 00:44:19.690
Keiko!

00:44:19.900 --> 00:44:22.030
You are afraid of me.

00:44:22.410 --> 00:44:23.960
Botan!

00:44:25.380 --> 00:44:27.870
I shall take the Power Sphere and this girl.

00:44:34.250 --> 00:44:39.990
Twice... I haven't been able to save Botan.

00:44:43.260 --> 00:44:46.230
Please, Yusuke.

00:44:47.430 --> 00:44:49.230
Even now,

00:44:49.330 --> 00:44:53.770
Botan is trying to prevent them from having their Power Sphere.

00:45:01.880 --> 00:45:03.850
It's no joke!

00:45:04.880 --> 00:45:08.180
You think I'll let you get away with that?!

00:45:12.890 --> 00:45:14.860
Yakumo!

00:45:22.900 --> 00:45:28.200
We may have no chance, but we cannot let it end this way!

00:45:40.080 --> 00:45:43.520
The Spirit World and Human World cannot be wiped out.

00:46:07.980 --> 00:46:11.310
This time we will start the attack from our side.

00:46:19.090 --> 00:46:21.680
Botan, I swear I will...

00:46:31.530 --> 00:46:33.200
Yusuke.

00:48:15.870 --> 00:48:17.360
Let's take a different road.

00:48:17.470 --> 00:48:20.770
No, it makes no difference.

00:48:30.950 --> 00:48:32.440
You are correct.

00:48:35.860 --> 00:48:38.450
- Kuronue!
- You know him?

00:48:38.560 --> 00:48:41.460
He was a partner of mine back when I was a thief.

00:48:41.560 --> 00:48:43.530
Let me take care of it.

00:48:48.740 --> 00:48:51.470
Kurama, are you still against your old partner?

00:48:51.840 --> 00:48:54.970
His old partner? Is he okay?

00:48:55.480 --> 00:48:57.450
Come, Kurama!

00:49:10.490 --> 00:49:12.090
Kurama!

00:49:55.540 --> 00:49:57.670
You are truly despicable.

00:50:02.880 --> 00:50:05.850
In the past, you fled and left me to die.

00:50:06.050 --> 00:50:09.020
Now, you are trying to destroy our dream.

00:50:13.890 --> 00:50:19.690
Kuronue, it is true that I could not rescue you that day...

00:50:19.900 --> 00:50:22.360
but please believe this. I--

00:50:22.570 --> 00:50:24.260
Silence!

00:50:36.780 --> 00:50:39.410
Kurama! Damn!

00:50:39.520 --> 00:50:42.490
We can't do anything in this fog.

00:50:43.290 --> 00:50:49.050
This is his problem. He has to resolve it himself.

00:50:52.030 --> 00:50:54.000
Rose Whip!

00:50:59.870 --> 00:51:02.340
What's wrong? You're not fighting back?

00:51:07.340 --> 00:51:10.310
Kuronue, what you are trying to do now is wrong.

00:51:11.510 --> 00:51:15.140
You say it's wrong? How dare you say that!

00:51:19.190 --> 00:51:21.020
Listen to me, Kuronue!

00:51:24.230 --> 00:51:25.990
Shut up!

00:51:32.870 --> 00:51:35.000
You still haven't remembered, have you ?

00:51:35.440 --> 00:51:37.770
Your dirty act.

00:52:05.740 --> 00:52:07.200
Traitor!

00:52:08.340 --> 00:52:12.470
Traitor! Traitor!

00:52:13.340 --> 00:52:17.970
Traitor! Traitor!

00:52:25.960 --> 00:52:28.080
What's that eerie noise?

00:52:46.640 --> 00:52:48.110
I thought so.

00:52:48.280 --> 00:52:50.180
What is it?

00:52:51.380 --> 00:52:55.440
He's causing many scythes like this to resonate and create a shield.

00:52:55.550 --> 00:52:58.150
Inside it, he is able to create evil hallucinations.

00:52:58.320 --> 00:53:00.720
So, Kurama has been tricked.

00:53:08.670 --> 00:53:12.230
Now you can make up for your ugly past!

00:53:13.970 --> 00:53:15.440
I...

00:53:15.870 --> 00:53:17.500
What's wrong, Kurama?

00:53:17.610 --> 00:53:22.510
You want to kill me to save yourself again?

00:53:25.620 --> 00:53:29.920
No, he's wrong. That time, his pendant...

00:53:32.460 --> 00:53:36.650
I will use this scythe to cleanse your ugly soul.

00:53:37.160 --> 00:53:39.130
What?

00:53:41.900 --> 00:53:43.590
Stop, Kuronue!

00:53:45.130 --> 00:53:48.930
Forget about me and run, Kurama!

00:53:49.810 --> 00:53:51.600
Now, the final blow!

00:54:12.760 --> 00:54:14.230
Die!

00:54:21.840 --> 00:54:24.400
Y-You...

00:54:24.610 --> 00:54:28.300
The one with the ugly rotten soul is you!

00:54:29.450 --> 00:54:31.910
You are not my old friend Kuronue!

00:54:33.750 --> 00:54:35.910
Show me your true form!

00:54:45.190 --> 00:54:46.890
How did you discover my trick?

00:54:47.000 --> 00:54:49.060
I could tell.

00:54:49.170 --> 00:54:53.660
First, Kuronue always carried this with him.

00:54:53.770 --> 00:54:55.600
He would never throw it away.

00:54:55.710 --> 00:54:59.510
What's more, no matter the circumstances...

00:54:59.610 --> 00:55:02.340
he would never attack an enemy from the rear.

00:55:02.510 --> 00:55:04.380
Take this!

00:55:07.720 --> 00:55:11.740
Kuronue risked his own life, telling me to run away.

00:55:11.850 --> 00:55:15.760
You twisted the friendship between me and Kuronue to your advantage!

00:55:34.180 --> 00:55:35.740
What's this?

00:55:56.670 --> 00:55:58.900
So even someone like you, who is so cool...

00:55:59.000 --> 00:56:00.970
occasionally gets angry.

00:56:01.070 --> 00:56:02.900
That's good to know.

00:56:07.780 --> 00:56:11.140
Not being able to rescue Kuronue that day--

00:56:11.250 --> 00:56:12.770
Kurama.

00:56:13.380 --> 00:56:17.910
There is no one who does not have scars on his heart.

00:56:18.590 --> 00:56:23.580
If there were someone like that, he would be a shallow bastard.

00:56:31.630 --> 00:56:33.100
Let's go!

00:56:33.570 --> 00:56:35.040
Okay.

00:57:13.780 --> 00:57:15.840
Damn! What do we do?

00:57:15.980 --> 00:57:18.140
We can cross at that flood gate!

00:57:18.250 --> 00:57:19.910
What?!

00:57:22.720 --> 00:57:24.690
All right, let's go!

00:57:30.060 --> 00:57:31.760
What?!

00:57:58.860 --> 00:58:00.830
W-Who is that?

00:58:04.700 --> 00:58:07.930
You maggots are persistent, aren't you?

00:58:09.600 --> 00:58:12.370
Oh, are you planning to fight again?

00:58:12.610 --> 00:58:15.410
It seems you won't learn till I crush you...

00:58:15.510 --> 00:58:19.040
Like that old lady and little girl in the temple.

00:58:20.010 --> 00:58:21.480
What?!

00:58:21.580 --> 00:58:25.350
You're the bastard who attacked Genkai and Yukina!

00:58:25.450 --> 00:58:28.790
And what if I was?

00:58:30.420 --> 00:58:32.590
Bastard!

00:58:32.690 --> 00:58:36.420
I, Kazuma Kuwabara, shall punish you!

00:58:40.900 --> 00:58:42.870
What are you doing, Hiei?!

00:58:44.070 --> 00:58:46.900
Leave this scum to me.

00:58:47.010 --> 00:58:49.810
You have no chance without your Spirit Energy!

00:58:55.580 --> 00:58:57.480
I will not let you live!

00:59:02.990 --> 00:59:04.480
What the...?

00:59:05.860 --> 00:59:10.920
You cannot treat me like the others, Hiei.

00:59:13.170 --> 00:59:17.230
You are no match for my Jagan eye!

00:59:17.340 --> 00:59:19.170
What...?

00:59:25.480 --> 00:59:29.180
That's Raigo, one of the four gods of the Netherworld.

00:59:29.280 --> 00:59:31.050
What type of creature is he?

00:59:31.750 --> 00:59:33.220
A very powerful one.

00:59:33.320 --> 00:59:35.310
He is a demon who can draw out wickedness...

00:59:35.420 --> 00:59:38.390
from his opponent's soul and manipulate it with his Jagan eye.

00:59:38.490 --> 00:59:41.020
Draw out wickedness...?

00:59:41.130 --> 00:59:44.100
Hiei is going to become evil!

00:59:55.140 --> 00:59:58.440
Take this, hell-scum!

01:00:09.760 --> 01:00:11.590
Damn.

01:00:15.260 --> 01:00:19.360
Let your eyes open to the evil which dwells in your soul!

01:00:19.470 --> 01:00:20.930
What...?

01:00:21.040 --> 01:00:26.060
Awaken the evil which sleeps in the depths of your heart!

01:00:41.620 --> 01:00:44.280
- W-What's that?!
- No, Hiei!

01:00:44.390 --> 01:00:47.590
If he looks into that evil abyss for too long...

01:00:47.700 --> 01:00:50.030
he will be pulled into their evil world.

01:00:59.270 --> 01:01:00.870
Jagan eyes!

01:01:02.310 --> 01:01:05.510
That is correct. Now the eyes will open...

01:01:05.610 --> 01:01:10.210
and you shall despise your friends.

01:01:10.320 --> 01:01:14.280
Your true character is an incarnation of evil!

01:01:14.390 --> 01:01:16.050
Go after them!

01:01:18.260 --> 01:01:23.530
Your power is now at its maximum.

01:01:24.900 --> 01:01:27.160
Smash them!

01:01:28.300 --> 01:01:30.700
Hiei! Stop!

01:01:48.160 --> 01:01:51.060
He's preparing for the Dragon of the Darkness Flame!

01:01:51.290 --> 01:01:54.990
We're doomed if he uses it!

01:02:03.370 --> 01:02:07.330
You cannot attack us, Hiei!

01:02:08.040 --> 01:02:10.310
Now! Fire, Hiei!

01:02:25.990 --> 01:02:29.490
Hiei, you bastard, showing us your true evil character!

01:02:36.340 --> 01:02:37.960
Hiei!

01:02:44.610 --> 01:02:46.940
Don't underestimate me!

01:02:47.250 --> 01:02:48.720
What?!

01:02:56.560 --> 01:02:58.020
You bastard!

01:03:35.460 --> 01:03:37.690
Part of the shield has...!

01:03:37.800 --> 01:03:40.100
A path has been opened!

01:03:40.330 --> 01:03:41.800
Hiei!

01:03:44.740 --> 01:03:50.140
Those Jagan eyes could not seduce my Black Dragon.

01:03:50.380 --> 01:03:52.240
W-What's going on?

01:03:52.350 --> 01:03:55.440
Hiei wasn't tricked at all.

01:04:01.490 --> 01:04:02.960
Hiei!

01:04:03.060 --> 01:04:06.360
Using the Dragon of the Darkness Flame against those Jagan eyes has...

01:04:06.460 --> 01:04:08.790
exhausted all his energy.

01:04:08.900 --> 01:04:10.520
Are you okay?

01:04:11.100 --> 01:04:14.230
Don't worry about me. There is no time. Hurry!

01:04:14.340 --> 01:04:16.240
Okay!

01:04:16.840 --> 01:04:18.960
- Let's go!
- Okay!

01:04:25.980 --> 01:04:31.010
Boy, you sure are a troublemaker.

01:04:31.690 --> 01:04:33.880
- Here we go.
- Kuwabara!

01:04:33.990 --> 01:04:37.650
We all have to see the conclusion. Let's go!

01:05:35.980 --> 01:05:37.540
That's it!

01:05:38.120 --> 01:05:39.680
Let's go.

01:05:46.230 --> 01:05:49.490
So, Raigo and the others are dead.

01:05:55.170 --> 01:05:57.570
It doesn't matter.

01:05:58.340 --> 01:06:01.710
If the Power Sphere of the Netherworld is returned...

01:06:01.810 --> 01:06:04.240
we will make the Human World our own.

01:06:04.350 --> 01:06:06.750
Our years of pain shall finally end.

01:06:09.750 --> 01:06:13.310
Now you shall return the Power Sphere of the Netherworld to me.

01:06:16.960 --> 01:06:18.890
Even unconscious,

01:06:18.990 --> 01:06:22.660
you are using your final bit of energy to resist.

01:06:22.760 --> 01:06:24.230
It is useless!

01:06:24.330 --> 01:06:27.770
I am the only one who can handle the Power Sphere!

01:06:31.270 --> 01:06:33.240
You will only suffer with it.

01:06:47.850 --> 01:06:49.480
Botan!

01:06:50.590 --> 01:06:52.850
- Wait!
- Leave!

01:07:02.970 --> 01:07:04.760
This is it!

01:07:07.970 --> 01:07:09.730
What?

01:07:10.040 --> 01:07:11.800
I will never give it to you!

01:07:12.840 --> 01:07:14.330
Botan!

01:07:14.480 --> 01:07:15.940
It is useless!

01:07:18.310 --> 01:07:20.280
Let go, woman!

01:07:23.420 --> 01:07:25.220
Botan!

01:07:29.990 --> 01:07:31.960
Botan!

01:07:33.130 --> 01:07:34.890
I'm sorry, Hinageshi.

01:07:35.000 --> 01:07:36.970
Involving you in this dangerous situation...

01:07:37.070 --> 01:07:38.800
Don't be ridiculous!

01:07:38.900 --> 01:07:41.890
I should have realized sooner.

01:07:42.000 --> 01:07:43.770
I'm sorry.

01:07:44.270 --> 01:07:46.140
T-Thank you.

01:07:46.240 --> 01:07:51.810
I knew that you would find out.

01:07:54.780 --> 01:07:56.250
Botan!

01:08:00.890 --> 01:08:02.450
Y-Yusuke.

01:08:02.560 --> 01:08:05.820
I couldn't protect...

01:08:05.930 --> 01:08:08.860
the Power Sphere.

01:08:08.960 --> 01:08:11.090
Get it back.

01:08:12.940 --> 01:08:15.670
Botan! Botan!

01:08:15.770 --> 01:08:17.240
Here I go.

01:08:18.340 --> 01:08:20.540
I won't let you die, Botan!

01:08:21.980 --> 01:08:25.070
I won't let you do whatever you want!

01:08:29.350 --> 01:08:32.180
The origin of the Netherworld's strength,

01:08:32.290 --> 01:08:35.260
the Power Sphere has returned.

01:08:35.360 --> 01:08:38.190
Now I shall restore our world.

01:08:39.300 --> 01:08:43.860
I shall become god and master of this place!

01:09:42.960 --> 01:09:46.620
Humans seem to be quite stupid creatures.

01:09:47.130 --> 01:09:49.960
Do you think you can match me?

01:09:50.470 --> 01:09:54.630
We don't necessarily attack because we think we can win.

01:09:54.740 --> 01:10:00.110
Then is the great aim of protecting the world for a sense of justice?

01:10:00.210 --> 01:10:01.680
That is wrong, too!

01:10:01.780 --> 01:10:05.110
What incomprehensible creatures.

01:10:13.160 --> 01:10:15.120
W-What is this?

01:10:16.360 --> 01:10:17.990
What's going on...?

01:10:18.090 --> 01:10:20.250
- Hurry!
- Okay.

01:10:30.410 --> 01:10:32.870
Botan! Hinageshi!

01:10:35.280 --> 01:10:40.150
I am going to create my own world. What is wrong with that?

01:10:42.320 --> 01:10:46.250
Why are you doing it in the Human World?

01:10:46.360 --> 01:10:49.650
You are the ones who called me.

01:10:49.760 --> 01:10:51.230
What?!

01:10:51.330 --> 01:10:54.160
You said, "Please visit."

01:10:56.170 --> 01:10:57.630
It is true...

01:10:57.730 --> 01:11:01.690
that my world was beaten in a battle with the Spirit World...

01:11:01.800 --> 01:11:05.260
and was sealed in the darkness of outer space.

01:11:05.540 --> 01:11:09.100
I waited patiently for an opportunity.

01:11:09.450 --> 01:11:13.210
And I collected the evil power of those humans...

01:11:13.320 --> 01:11:16.610
who were sent into space by the Spirit World.

01:11:16.720 --> 01:11:20.280
I gathered enough power to destroy the seal.

01:11:21.060 --> 01:11:24.820
I seem to get along just fine with that evil human power...

01:11:25.290 --> 01:11:28.750
which the Spirit World could not handle.

01:11:31.830 --> 01:11:33.600
Damn.

01:11:33.700 --> 01:11:37.570
Our souls set him loose!

01:11:37.970 --> 01:11:39.440
What happened?

01:11:39.540 --> 01:11:45.040
Now I shall let you taste the power of human beings' wicked hearts!

01:12:21.550 --> 01:12:24.640
- He's just playing around!
- It's no match!

01:12:26.660 --> 01:12:28.620
D-Damn!

01:12:35.000 --> 01:12:36.460
Yusuke!

01:12:37.730 --> 01:12:42.230
You should not waste your remaining bit of Spirit Energy.

01:12:46.440 --> 01:12:47.910
He's fast!

01:12:50.410 --> 01:12:52.640
Hurry and get behind the pole!

01:12:56.120 --> 01:12:57.590
Botan.

01:13:23.180 --> 01:13:24.770
Spirit gun!

01:13:51.340 --> 01:13:53.140
What happened?

01:13:53.240 --> 01:13:55.230
This is my world.

01:13:55.440 --> 01:13:58.380
I said everything is according to my thoughts.

01:13:58.480 --> 01:14:00.450
You cannot harm me.

01:14:01.520 --> 01:14:05.010
You are a fool, harming yourself with your own power.

01:14:05.590 --> 01:14:09.580
Have you wasted your remaining bit of Spirit Energy?

01:14:09.690 --> 01:14:12.060
This is no good!

01:14:16.060 --> 01:14:17.930
I'll make this the end!

01:14:24.340 --> 01:14:26.200
Kuwabara!

01:14:34.020 --> 01:14:35.570
What?!

01:14:35.680 --> 01:14:39.750
You fool. Yusuke isn't your only opponent.

01:14:39.860 --> 01:14:43.660
Did you forget that I'm still here?!

01:15:00.140 --> 01:15:03.810
What can you, a human being without Spirit Energy, do?

01:15:10.850 --> 01:15:15.420
Kuwabara! I'm the one fighting!

01:15:18.360 --> 01:15:20.790
S-Stop! I'm...

01:15:24.330 --> 01:15:28.270
You rest there! I'll finish him off now.

01:15:31.240 --> 01:15:33.070
Are you protecting each other?

01:15:33.180 --> 01:15:35.140
What's so funny?

01:15:35.910 --> 01:15:37.740
The reason you are weak...

01:15:37.850 --> 01:15:42.110
is because you are stuck believing in that facile friendship.

01:15:43.390 --> 01:15:44.850
Shut up!

01:15:46.760 --> 01:15:49.320
Don't you know the meaning of fear?

01:15:50.230 --> 01:15:54.990
Your body should be feeling the disparity in our power.

01:16:07.980 --> 01:16:12.880
The time has come to change the Human World into the Netherworld!

01:16:35.040 --> 01:16:37.870
Damn! What's happening?

01:16:40.510 --> 01:16:45.340
Die! I shall blow away you and your world!

01:16:47.420 --> 01:16:50.440
Return the Power Sphere of the Netherworld!

01:16:56.790 --> 01:16:58.260
Give it back!

01:16:58.360 --> 01:17:02.560
You can't keep that thing which Botan almost died to...!

01:17:04.070 --> 01:17:05.660
Hinageshi!

01:17:20.480 --> 01:17:21.950
Hinageshi!

01:17:35.660 --> 01:17:37.500
Don't mess with me!

01:17:37.600 --> 01:17:39.290
Stop! You'll die!

01:17:48.840 --> 01:17:50.710
Hiei! Kurama!

01:17:52.950 --> 01:17:58.410
Yu... Yusuke... What happened to the Power Sphere?

01:18:00.690 --> 01:18:04.680
I have no more Spirit Energy.

01:18:04.790 --> 01:18:07.020
But in there...

01:18:13.040 --> 01:18:14.660
What's wrong, boy?

01:18:15.970 --> 01:18:18.440
You are certainly strong...

01:18:18.810 --> 01:18:22.940
and we may simply not be a match for you.

01:18:28.580 --> 01:18:30.050
But...

01:18:31.820 --> 01:18:34.410
But, if I did nothing...

01:18:36.830 --> 01:18:41.290
I could not forgive myself!.

01:18:48.170 --> 01:18:49.640
It is useless.

01:18:49.740 --> 01:18:52.210
Even Emperor Enma of the Spirit World...

01:18:52.310 --> 01:18:56.180
could not handle the Power Sphere of the Netherworld and had to seal it up.

01:18:56.280 --> 01:18:58.640
I am the only one who can manage it.

01:19:03.050 --> 01:19:04.520
Yusuke.

01:19:07.560 --> 01:19:09.020
Yusuke!

01:19:09.460 --> 01:19:10.930
Yusuke...

01:19:30.650 --> 01:19:35.240
Now, into my hands the Power Sphere of the Netherworld--

01:19:48.400 --> 01:19:50.460
What? Impossible!

01:19:51.770 --> 01:19:53.230
Yusuke!

01:20:01.810 --> 01:20:04.710
Yusuke is burning his soul into pure power.

01:20:36.440 --> 01:20:38.110
Kuwabara!

01:20:38.710 --> 01:20:44.280
Let me help you, Yusuke. I have too much Spirit Energy.

01:20:52.930 --> 01:20:54.660
Do it, Yusuke!

01:20:54.760 --> 01:20:56.320
I can't wait.

01:20:56.430 --> 01:20:58.630
Kurama, Hiei, let's go!

01:21:01.540 --> 01:21:03.000
It can't be!

01:21:03.100 --> 01:21:07.540
Does he really have the strength to change the Netherworld's power...

01:21:08.680 --> 01:21:10.980
into Spirit Energy?

01:21:18.620 --> 01:21:21.850
The feelings of all four have become one.

01:22:00.900 --> 01:22:02.860
Take this!

01:22:11.540 --> 01:22:13.010
Go!

01:23:20.180 --> 01:23:21.870
Did we do it?

01:23:32.420 --> 01:23:33.890
It's over.

01:23:34.620 --> 01:23:36.990
It has finally been settled.

01:23:38.460 --> 01:23:39.930
Where are Hinageshi and Botan?

01:23:40.700 --> 01:23:42.660
Let's find them!

01:23:49.900 --> 01:23:51.870
Hinageshi!

01:24:19.630 --> 01:24:21.300
Guys!

01:24:49.030 --> 01:24:51.690
This is my final blow!

01:24:54.470 --> 01:24:57.960
Take this! Spirit Gun!

01:26:51.620 --> 01:26:53.250
Botan!

01:26:53.820 --> 01:26:56.720
Hang in there, Botan!

01:26:57.630 --> 01:26:59.290
Botan!

01:27:05.370 --> 01:27:07.100
Koenma.

01:27:07.970 --> 01:27:09.770
Is it you, Koenma!

01:27:33.600 --> 01:27:35.930
A-Are we still alive?

01:27:45.670 --> 01:27:47.970
Has the Spirit World been restored?!

01:27:59.620 --> 01:28:01.920
Yusuke.

01:28:34.660 --> 01:28:38.150
- It's finally over.
- Yeah, somehow.

01:28:38.260 --> 01:28:40.850
Did that bastard really die?

01:28:40.960 --> 01:28:44.960
I don't know. He could be hiding among us.

01:28:45.330 --> 01:28:47.300
That's not even funny!

01:28:47.400 --> 01:28:51.360
But if he is, we'll give him another good beating!
